[executive]
# ============================================================================
# O_o_Reader test model: topology, topometry and topography in one run (SOL 200)
#
# Covers:
#   - cards: TOPVAR TOMVAR BEADVAR
#   - solution: SOL 200 (static compliance minimisation, mass constraints)
#   - outputs: displacements of each design cycle, the design history
#     (HISADD)
# Run notes:
#   - the run stops after DESMAX cycles whether or not it has converged; the
#     optimised densities, thicknesses and grid moves are in the listing and
#     the .pch (PARAM,DESPCH)
# Written for this project, to exercise the reader.
# How to run it, what to bring back: validation/models/README.md.
# ============================================================================
SolutionSequence;200
[case]
TitleText;O_o_Reader test model: topology, topometry, topography
BulkEcho;Sorted
SinglePointConstrSelection;1
StaticLoadSelection;1
DesignObjectiveSelection;31;MinimumObjective
AnalysisKind;Statics
DisplacementOutput;All;PlotOnly
SubcaseStart;1
LabelText;tip edge load
SubcaseDesignConstrSelection;40
[model]
Parameter;PostprocessingFile;-1
Parameter;DesignPunchOutput;1
# A cantilever aluminium plate 120 x 60 mm, 12 x 6 CQUAD4 of 10 mm, clamped
# at x = 0 and loaded out of plane along the free edge x = 120. Root third:
# PSHELL 2 (topometry); middle third: PSHELL 1 (topology); tip third:
# PSHELL 3 (topography, beads). Units: mm, N, t, s.
