# Topology region: the density of each element of PSHELL 1 (penalty 3).
DesignTopologyRegion;1;MIDDLE;ShellProp;0.5;0.001;;;1
# Topometry region: the thickness of each element of PSHELL 2, from 1 to 4
# mm.
DesignTopometryRegion;2;ShellProp;2;thickness;2.;1.;4.
# Topography region: beads of PSHELL 3 along the element normals, 20 mm wide
# at least, 4 mm high at most, 60 degrees of draw angle, both sides allowed.
DesignBeadRegion;3;ShellProp;3;20.;4.;60.;;;DesignVar;ElementNormals;;;;-1.;1.
# Responses: compliance (objective), mass fraction of the topology region
# and the total weight (constraints).
DesignResp1;31;COMPL;TotalCompliance
DesignResp1;32;FRMASS;FractionalMass;ShellProp;;;;1
DesignResp1;33;WEIGHT;Weight
